2. Use the Text_Detector_Tool tool to detect text in the image, including English and German languages.
3. Choose one of the detected text blocks that appears in both languages.
4. Verify that the recognized text is "baseball" and extract the coordinates and confidence scores for the bounding box of the detected letter.
5. Since we are interested in the countertop that is next to the wooden material, we will focus on the coordinates and scores of the bounding box of the detected "baseball".

Using the Text_Detector_Tool tool: 
